sn35.69:2.3 | S: Yet you say: | T: yet the Venerable Upasena says:
sn35.69:2.4 | S: ‘Come, reverends, lift this body onto a cot and carry it outside | T: ‘Come, friends, lift this body of mine on to the bed and carry it outside before it is scattered right here like a handful of chaff.’”
